Most people say that classes like English, math, and science should take up most of the school day. These classes help get students ready for high school, college, and careers.

We shouldn''t forget that physical education is also important. Some people think that PE isn''t important. However, most health experts say that everyone should get 30 minutes of exercise a day to be healthy. Some exercises, like running, are good for the heart and lungs. Others, like lifting weights, help build strong bones. Studies have shown that exercise is very important for kids. Being active helps young bodies and minds grow.

Our schools should have one hour of PE every day. Students can use this time to clear their minds and be ready to learn in their other classes. Exercise can help them feel better and be happier. Teachers are sure to like that!', NULL, NULL, 1, 'MAP_RC_G2-4_PAST', 'PUBLISHED') ON CONFLICT (mpg_id) DO UPDATE SET mpg_body = EXCLUDED.mpg_body, mpg_glossary = EXCLUDED.mpg_glossary, mpg_pair_group_id = EXCLUDED.mpg_pair_group_id, mpg_grade = EXCLUDED.mpg_grade, updated_at = NOW();


