Parrots are birds. Some are very large. Others are small. Most parrots are very brightly colored. Some parrots have feathers in every color of the rainbow.

Parrots are found in rain forests around the world. They like to live in large groups. Many parrots are good at copying sounds.

Some people keep parrots as pets. People enjoy parrots because of their beautiful colors. Parrots are smart and fun to watch, too. Parrots often learn to say the words and phrases their owners teach them to say.

Parrots can be great pets, but they take a lot of work. They can live a long time. And they need a lot of attention.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'MAP_RC_G2-4_PAST', 'PUBLISHED') ON CONFLICT (mpg_id) DO UPDATE SET mpg_body = EXCLUDED.mpg_body, mpg_glossary = EXCLUDED.mpg_glossary, mpg_pair_group_id = EXCLUDED.mpg_pair_group_id, mpg_grade = EXCLUDED.mpg_grade, updated_at = NOW();





