"I''ve got some bad news, kids," Dad said at breakfast. "It''s supposed to rain all day, so we can''t go to the beach."

"But we''ve been planning this for weeks!" wailed Elisa.

"I''m sorry, kiddo," said Dad, "but we''ll just have to go another day."

I couldn''t help but smile because, although I had been looking forward to a day at the beach, the rain gave me a chance to try out my new rain tent.

The first drops started falling as I put the last pole in place. I ran inside and grabbed beanbags, games, and flashlights.

"Come on." I said to Elisa, who was still getting over her disappointment.

It could pour all day long, but we would be nice and dry, playing games and telling stories inside my tent.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'MAP_RC_G2-4_PAST', 'PUBLISHED') ON CONFLICT (mpg_id) DO UPDATE SET mpg_body = EXCLUDED.mpg_body, mpg_glossary = EXCLUDED.mpg_glossary, mpg_pair_group_id = EXCLUDED.mpg_pair_group_id, mpg_grade = EXCLUDED.mpg_grade, updated_at = NOW();


"Here you are, Simone," the librarian said, handing me a library card. "The children''s section is down this hall."

"Thank you," I said, turning in the direction the librarian had pointed.

I walked to the end of the hall and was greeted by an amazing sight. The room was bigger than my whole house and was filled with

beautiful, brightly colored books just waiting to be read. In one corner, the shelves were barely three feet tall. Little kids snuggled up with their

grown-ups and read books together or played with toys. Beanbags, scattered everywhere, begged people to grab books and curl up in them. There were big, colorful rugs that provided space for babies to crawl around or for groups of kids to play games. Hidden nooks filled with pillows offered quiet, cozy reading areas.

I could stay here forever, I thought.', NULL, NULL, 1, 'MAP_RC_G2-4_PAST', 'PUBLISHED') ON CONFLICT (mpg_id) DO UPDATE SET mpg_body = EXCLUDED.mpg_body, mpg_glossary = EXCLUDED.mpg_glossary, mpg_pair_group_id = EXCLUDED.mpg_pair_group_id, mpg_grade = EXCLUDED.mpg_grade, updated_at = NOW();



